# LICENSE V4

## Definitions

(Throughout this document:
A "Work" is defined as:
    any tangible object or digital construct made directly or indirectly with human hands -
    A few examples include: a drawing, a car, a photograph, a digital artwork, a screenshot, a database, a video and a webpage.
An "AI-assisted Work" is defined as:
    a Work made with ANY assistance, no matter how small, from a Generative Artificial Intelligence.
An "Unprotected Work" is defined as:
    any work to which you currently have a valid license that permits
    the use, copying, modification and reproduction of the work
    without the requirement of accreditation,
and a "Protected Work" is defined as:
    any work that is not an "Unprotected Work")

